,\"justifyContent\":\"space-between\",\"alignItems\":\"center\"},\"children\":[\"What does an image compressor do?\",[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"style\":{\"fontSize\":\"1.25rem\",\"color\":\"var(--success)\"},\"children\":\"+\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-muted\",\"style\":{\"fontSize\":\"0.9rem\",\"margin\":\"0.5rem 0 0 0\",\"paddingTop\":\"0.5rem\",\"borderTop\":\"1px solid var(--border-color)\"},\"children\":\"An image compressor reduces the file size of your images by stripping unnecessary metadata, optimizing color profiles, and applying compression algorithms. It allows you to shrink photos and graphics without losing noticeable visual quality. By reducing the overall file size, you can make your website load significantly faster, improve search engine optimization, and save storage space.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"card\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"style\":{\"fontSize\":\"1.05rem\",\"fontWeight\":\"600\",\"cursor\":\"pointer\",\"padding\":\"0.5rem 0\",\"listStyle\":\"none\",\"display\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"space-between\",\"alignItems\":\"center\"},\"children\":[\"Will image compression reduce image quality?\",[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"style\":{\"fontSize\":\"1.25rem\",\"color\":\"var(--success)\"},\"children\":\"+\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-muted\",\"style\":{\"fontSize\":\"0.9rem\",\"margin\":\"0.5rem 0 0 0\",\"paddingTop\":\"0.5rem\",\"borderTop\":\"1px solid var(--border-color)\"},\"children\":\"Yes, image compression can reduce quality if you choose high compression levels, but with our tool, the visual impact is virtually invisible. By drawing your image onto a canvas and optimizing the export settings, our compressor maintains a fine balance. Setting the compression slider between 70% and 85% yields massive file size savings of up to 80% while preserving sharpness.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"card\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"style\":{\"fontSize\":\"1.05rem\",\"fontWeight\":\"600\",\"cursor\":\"pointer\",\"padding\":\"0.5rem 0\",\"listStyle\":\"none\",\"display\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"space-between\",\"alignItems\":\"center\"},\"children\":[\"Which image formats are supported?\",[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"style\":{\"fontSize\":\"1.25rem\",\"color\":\"var(--success)\"},\"children\":\"+\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-muted\",\"style\":{\"fontSize\":\"0.9rem\",\"margin\":\"0.5rem 0 0 0\",\"paddingTop\":\"0.5rem\",\"borderTop\":\"1px solid var(--border-color)\"},\"children\":\"Our browser-based image compressor supports the three most popular web image formats: JPEG, PNG, and WebP. You can upload any of these file types, adjust the compression quality slider, and save the optimized image. The compressor handles each format's distinct traits, like transparency for PNG and WebP, or high-density colors for JPEG files.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"card\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"style\":{\"fontSize\":\"1.05rem\",\"fontWeight\":\"600\",\"cursor\":\"pointer\",\"padding\":\"0.5rem 0\",\"listStyle\":\"none\",\"display\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"space-between\",\"alignItems\":\"center\"},\"children\":[\"Can I compress images on my phone?\",[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"style\":{\"fontSize\":\"1.25rem\",\"color\":\"var(--success)\"},\"children\":\"+\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-muted\",\"style\":{\"fontSize\":\"0.9rem\",\"margin\":\"0.5rem 0 0 0\",\"paddingTop\":\"0.5rem\",\"borderTop\":\"1px solid var(--border-color)\"},\"children\":\"Absolutely! Since our tool is built using standard responsive web technologies, you can compress images directly on your mobile device. Just open the tool in your mobile browser, select an image from your photo library or take a new one, adjust the quality, and download the compressed file. It requires no application downloads.\"}]]}],\"$L26\",\"$L27\",\"$L28\"]}]]}]\n25:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"style\":{\"borderTop\":\"1px solid var(--border-color)\",\"paddingTop\":\"3rem\"},\"aria-labelledby\":\"related-heading\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"id\":\"related-heading\",\"className\":\"mb-6\",\"children\":[\"Related \",\"Image Tools\"]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"grid-cols-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L8\",\"img-resizer\",{\"href\":\"/tools/image/image-resizer\",\"className\":\"card card-hover flex flex-col gap-2\",\"style\":{\"textDecoration\":\"none\",\"color\":\"inherit\",\"padding\":\"1.25rem\"},\"aria-label\":\"Open Image Resizer - Resize images to custom pixel dimensions or preset percentages with aspect ratio lock.\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"style\":{\"fontSize\":\"1rem\",\"margin\":0},\"children\":\"Image Resizer\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-muted\",\"style\":{\"fontSize\":\"0.8rem\",\"margin\":0,\"flexGrow\":1,\"overflow\":\"hidden\",\"textOverflow\":\"ellipsis\",\"display\":\"-webkit-box\",\"WebkitLineClamp\":2,\"WebkitBoxOrient\":\"vertical\"},\"children\":\"Resize images to custom pixel dimensions or preset percentages with aspect ratio lock.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L8\",\"img-jpg-to-png\",{\"href\":\"/tools/image/jpg-to-png-converter\",\"className\":\"card card-hover flex flex-col gap-2\",\"style\":{\"textDecoration\":\"none\",\"color\":\"inherit\",\"padding\":\"1.25rem\"},\"aria-label\":\"Open JPG to PNG Converter - Convert JPG/JPEG images to PNG format instantly while maintaining original quality.\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"style\":{\"fontSize\":\"1rem\",\"margin\":0},\"children\":\"JPG to PNG Converter\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-muted\",\"style\":{\"fontSize\":\"0.8rem\",\"margin\":0,\"flexGrow\":1,\"overflow\":\"hidden\",\"textOverflow\":\"ellipsis\",\"display\":\"-webkit-box\",\"WebkitLineClamp\":2,\"WebkitBoxOrient\":\"vertical\"},\"children\":\"Convert JPG/JPEG images to PNG format instantly wh